{'symbol': 'WAB', 'date': '2023-05-17 16:30:00', 'title': 'WABTEC DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY COMMON DIVIDEND', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WABTEC CORPORATION (NYSE: WAB) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY COMMON DIVIDEND OF 17 CENTS PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON JUNE 9, 2023 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD ON MAY 30, 2023. ABOUT WABTEC WABTEC CORPORATION (NYSE: WAB) IS REVOLUTIONIZING THE WAY THE WORLD MOVES FOR FUTURE GENERATIONS. THE COMPANY IS A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF EQUIPMENT, SYSTEMS, DIGITAL SOLUTIONS AND VALUE-ADDED SERVICES FOR THE FREIGHT AND TRANSIT RAIL INDUSTRIES, AS.'}